mes>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Shimizu</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>A series of ENU-induced single-base substitutions in a long-range cis-element altering Sonic hedgehog expression in the developing mouse limb bud</article-title><source>Genomics</source><year>2007</year><volume>89</volume><fpage>207</fpage><lpage>214</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17049204</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DDN141C13"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lettice</surname><given-names>L.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hill</surname><given-names>A.E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Devenney</surname><given-names>P.S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hill</surname><given-names>R.E.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Point mutations in a distant sonic hedgehog cis-reulator generate a variable regulatory output responsible for preaxial polydactyly</article-title><source>Hum. Mol. Genet.</source><year>2008</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>978</fpage><lpage>985</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18156157</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DDN141C14"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gurnett</surname><given-names>C.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bowcock</surname><given-names>A.M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Dietz</surname><given-names>F.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Morcuende</surname><given-names>J.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Murray</surname><given-names>J.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Dobbs</surname><given-names>M.B.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Two novel point mutations in the long-range SHH enhancer in three families with triphalangeal thumb and preaxial polydactyly</article-title><source>Am. J. Med. Genet.</source><year>2007</year><volume>143A</volume><fpage>27</fpage><lpage>32</lpage></citation></